{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14884","headline":"客舍喜崔补阙司空拾遗访宿 · 卢纶","name":"客舍喜崔补阙司空拾遗访宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"步月访诸邻，蓬居宿近臣。\n乌裘先醉客，清镜早朝人。\n坏壁烟垂网，香街火照尘。\n悲荣俱是分，吾亦乐吾贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}